  "description": "When I was hit by a truck and opened my eyes, a completely different world unfolded before it.\nThis world is a little strange. No, there are only a couple of things that are strange.\n\nFirst of all, women rule the country. And all her concubines are men. In addition, the next emperor is selected through competition rather than through a system of succession to the throne.\nAnd the strangest thing is the fact that I am participating in the contest for the throne.\n\nRyu Jeong-Ha, a woman in her 20s in Korea who fell into a world where a woman becomes the emperor and her man becomes her concubine. \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
